# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
*.env
# ...and any archive/backup of them. `.env*` does NOT match `Env.zip`,
# `env-backup.tar.gz`, `.env.local copy`, etc. Be broad here on purpose.
[Ee]nv.zip
[Ee]nv*.zip
*env*.zip
*env*.tar
*env*.tar.gz
*env*.7z
*env*.bak
*.env.*
*secrets*.zip

# local-only secrets / instructions
CLAUDE.local.md

